      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Go search the Haunted Cave for the Gravestone of the Elder Seer, if you dare...",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Malorn_Ashthorn.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/MalornAshthorn_QST_04.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 81102,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "As they say, knowledge is power. I think it's about time you do some research.  You will need to go to the Haunted Cave.  That is, if you are brave enough.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Malorn_Ashthorn.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/MalornAshthorn_QST_05.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 81102,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Once there, search around the graveyard for where the Elder Seer is buried. Remember, a graveyard wouldn't scare a Death student. At least, not a brave one...",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Malorn_Ashthorn.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/MalornAshthorn_QST_06.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 81102,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Congratulations on entering the Haunted Cave and learning from the Elder Seer. It is a tradition to seek it out in order to grow in power.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Malorn_Ashthorn.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/MalornAshthorn_QST_07.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 81102,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Hmmmmmm... I may make a Death student out of you yet! But you'll have to really bone up on your studies... Heheheh... An old Death school joke...",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Malorn_Ashthorn.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/MalornAshthorn_QST_08.mp3",
